OL,3,GNEWSASchool reassures parents after
OL,4,Apupil-linked stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA secondary school in Peterborough has
OL,7,Freassured parents after a 14-year-old
OL,8,Fwas stabbed on nearby playing fields.
OL,10,FThe boy was taken to Peterborough City
OL,11,FHospital with serious injuries after
OL,12,Fthe incident in Bushfield, near
OL,13,FOrmiston Bushfield Academy in Orton
OL,14,FGoldhay, at about 16:00 BST on Monday.
OL,16,FA 14-year-old boy from Peterborough has
OL,17,Fbeen charged with grievous bodily harm
OL,18,F(GBH), possession of a knife and theft.
OL,19,FA second 14-year-old boy, also from the
OL,20,Fcity, was arrested on suspicion of GBH
OL,21,Fand assisting an offender.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
