OL,3,GNEWSASchool reassures parents after
OL,4,Apupil-linked stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a letter to parents, the school said
OL,7,Fthe incident involved "a small group of
OL,8,Fstudents from the academy" and it was
OL,9,F"treating it extremely seriously".
